  "comment": "A `World` stores and manages [`Body`](#link) and [`Particle`](#link) for 2D physics simulation.\nIt advances with a substepped position-based (XPBD-style) solver and a spatial-hash broad phase.\nSee a [Particle demo](../demo/index.html?name=physics.particles) and a [Body demo](../demo/index.html?name=physics.shapes) on the demo page.",
